& [PostP5ReadinessSurfaceV1] is the current readiness surface after P5 LangGraph procedure runtime planning acceptance
  + [surface_state] is ready_for_next_deeper_reasoning_design_selection
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is PostP8ReadinessSurfaceV1
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is P5LangGraphProcedureRuntimeFinalSliceSurfaceV1
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is P5BoundaryImportAndRuntimeObligationInventoryV1
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is P5GraphProcedureStateEnvelopeAndCheckpointNonauthorityContractV1
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is P5OperatorNodeMappingAndDeterministicTransitionContractV1
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is P5SOPInterruptHumanJudgmentHandoffAndRebakeRouteContractV1
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is P5RuntimeProofTraceFixturePlanAndNoLiveEffectExecutionBoundaryV1
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is P5LangGraphAdapterDependencyDeferralAndImplementationActivationBoundaryV1
  + [active_implementation_chunk] is none
  + [current_ready_chunk] is P6 surface projection system final slice minting
  + [secondary_ready_chunk] is P8 fixture material implementation activation after P6 surface projection requirements are reviewed
  + [secondary_ready_chunk] is P5 runtime implementation activation after dependency and adapter authority are source-preserved and accepted
  + [gated_chunk] is dependency installation, package metadata mutation, adapters, transports, UI, graph runtime execution, assignment, dispatch, operations control, and live machine control until explicit accepted authority opens bounded work
  + [safety_limit] is no assignment, dispatch, operations control, or live machine control authorized

  = must: choose the next slice from current support, completed-work deltas, and whole-field dependency closure
  = must: run completion review after each new design, planning, proof, or implementation slice before opening downstream slices
  = must: preserve checkpoint nonauthority, generated trace nonpromotion, no-assignment, no-dispatch, no-operations-control, no-live-control, and SOP interrupt boundaries in downstream work

& [ReadinessChunk: P6SurfaceProjectionSystem] is ready_for_final_slice_minting
  + [chunk_id] is P6
  + [chunk_name] is surface projection system
  + [dependency_set] is P2 authority kernel and record schemas
  + [dependency_set] is P4 whole-field planning and packetization
  + [dependency_set] is P5 LangGraph procedure runtime planning authority
  + [dependency_set] is P8 proof fixtures, generated-output nonpromotion, and proof ledger authority
  + [expected_output_set] is source-preserved P6 final slice surface
  + [expected_output_set] is authority notice and freshness rendering contract
  + [expected_output_set] is manager, worker, narrative, debug, chat, Codex, terminal, IRC, Matrix, web, and optional Langflow projection boundaries
  + [expected_output_set] is projection fixture and snapshot proof planning without projection implementation
  + [model_route] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [model_route_reason] is surface projection decides how authority, stale state, nonpromotion, checkpoint nonauthority, interrupts, and human handoffs are visible across conversation surfaces
  + [future_Spark_suitable_work] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable bounded projection fixture generation only after P6 final slices and implementation activation accept exact projection contracts and fixture paths

  = must: source-preserve, SJS-process, and final-slice P6 before trusting surface projection expansion as current authority
  = must: keep surfaces as projections and reviewable interaction layers, not direct canonical authority mutation paths

& [PostP5RuntimeStatus] is the accepted P5 status for downstream design
  + [runtime_boundary_import_status] is accepted
  + [graph_state_envelope_status] is accepted_contract_only
  + [checkpoint_nonauthority_status] is accepted_contract_only
  + [operator_node_mapping_status] is accepted_contract_only
  + [transition_record_status] is accepted_contract_only
  + [SOP_interrupt_handoff_status] is accepted_contract_only
  + [runtime_proof_trace_fixture_status] is accepted_plan_only
  + [LangGraph_dependency_status] is deferred
  + [adapter_status] is not_implemented
  + [runtime_implementation_status] is not_authorized
  + [graph_runtime_execution_status] is not_authorized
  + [assignment_status] is not_authorized
  + [dispatch_status] is not_authorized
  + [operations_control_status] is not_authorized
  + [live_control_status] is not_authorized

  = must: require downstream P6 planning to render checkpoint nonauthority, SOP interrupt handoffs, generated trace nonpromotion, stale state, and blocked gates explicitly
  = must: mark downstream designs stale if P5 source, graph state contract, checkpoint nonauthority, operator node mapping, interrupt contract, proof trace plan, dependency decision, completion review, or this readiness surface changes

& [PostP5ReadinessClosureReview] is the dependency audit for the post-P5 readiness surface
  + [P5-S01_status] is accepted
  + [P5-S02_status] is accepted
  + [P5-S03_status] is accepted
  + [P5-S04_status] is accepted
  + [P5-S05_status] is accepted
  + [P5-S06_status] is accepted
  + [P5_completion_status] is accepted_by docs/reviews/P5_Completion_Review.v1.sop
  + [current_ready_chunk_set] is P6 surface projection system final slice minting
  + [conditionally_ready_chunk_set] is P8 fixture material implementation activation after P6 surface projection requirements are reviewed
  + [conditionally_ready_chunk_set] is P5 runtime implementation activation after source-preserved activation authority is accepted
  + [unresolved_external_dependency_set] is future P6 source-preserved final slice specification
  + [forbidden_external_dependency_found] is false
  + [dependency_installation_authorized] is false
  + [package_metadata_mutation_authorized] is false
  + [adapter_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [graph_runtime_execution_authorized] is false
  + [assignment_authorized] is false
  + [manager_dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [agent_dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [operations_control_authorized] is false
  + [live_machine_control_authorized] is false

  = must: treat P6 final slice minting as ready and deeper-reasoning required
  = must: treat implementation activation, adapter work, transport work, UI work, dispatch authority, live-control authority, and downstream operations execution as gated, not ready
